  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Demographic Health Survey - Micronutrient component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Demographic and Health Survey Tanzania 2020/21 nutrition component
Basket funding through UNICEF co-financed by USAID, Canada, Irish Aid,DFID and Nutrition International. Survey implemented by ICF, National Bureau of Statistics (NBS) and Tanzania Food and Nutrition Center (TFNC). The Demographic and Health Survey (DHS) will include a nutrition component which will provide input to future planning on support to the National Multi-sectoral Nutrition Action Plan (NMNAP). Nutrition sensitive agriculture and education on nutrition are important aspects of this multisectoral plan.</narrative>
  </description>
